Third-party work
----------------
Parts of this project build on, call or modify code from the OpenFront game
(OpenFrontIO), which is licensed under AGPL-3.0. That code remains copyright
of its original authors. The files below contain our modifications or
additions and are distributed under the same license:
  - bot/BotExecution.ts, bot/v34/BotExecution.ts (bot built on the game's
    Nation AI behaviors; modified 2026)
  - bot/harness/* (headless test scripts that run the game engine)
  - engine-patch/autoplay.patch (a patch to the game; modified 2026)
  - userscript-source/* (bundles the game engine when you build it)
The game's source code is not included in this repository. setup.sh and the build
steps download it from its official public source.

openfront-bot.user.js (and any userscript built with userscript-source/build.mjs)
contains a compiled copy of the OpenFront game engine (AGPL-3.0). Its
corresponding source is the OpenFrontIO repository at the tag named in the
script's @description (v0.35.4 for the current script;
https://github.com/openfrontio/OpenFrontIO) plus bot/BotExecution.ts (or
bot/v34/BotExecution.ts for v0.34 builds) and userscript-source/ in this
repository. If you share a built userscript, AGPL-3.0 requires you to also
offer its complete corresponding source.

